  "description": "Mongoose was born from BMX racing with products that push the limits of what a rider can do on the track. Our latest line of BMX race bikes, the Title series, have been designed using that same race pedigree. Designed for beginner-level riders, the Mongoose Title Pro 24 gives you a trophy-worthy cruiser at an amazingly affordable price!\nDesigned for beginners or riders returning to the sport, the Mongoose Title 24 BMX race bike is a trophy-worthy cruiser at an amazingly affordable price. Suggested rider height is 5'7\" and taller.\nLightweight Tectonic® T1 aluminum frame, integrated headset and internal cable routing for clean lines and added protection. 21.77” top tube length and frame weight of 3.44 lbs.\nThe Title’s drivetrain features 175mm 3-piece tubular chromoly cranks with a 42T chainring and euro cartridge bottom bracket.\nThe wheelset features Arisun XLR8 24” tires mounted on Xposure® aluminum double wall rims with aluminum ball bearing front hub and 18T cog freewheel rear hub.\nAlloy V-brake and brake levers offer quality speed control, while the Hi-Ten steel handlebar and fork are joined by a 48mm stem and sealed bearing headset to combine for excellent steering performance.",
